# CMSIS-Geraeteheader/Startup-Templates fuer nicht verwendete Controller-Varianten
**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Include/stm32f[0-9][0-9][0-9]*.h
!**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Include/stm32f407xx.h
!**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Include/stm32f072xb.h
!**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Include/stm32f103xb.h
**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Source/Templates/arm/
**/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/*/Source/Templates/iar/
